      "actions": 2,
      "traits": [
        "divine"
      ],
      "description": "<p>The carved maggots in the blade of the rotcarver scythe shoot out in a 30ft Cone, transforming into a swarm of locusts. Creatures in the area take 5d6 Piercing Damage damage as they're cut by the locusts' spurs (Basic DC 21 Reflex Saving Throw save). The locust knight can't use this ability again for 1d4 rounds.</p>",
